WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.170
Your AI wrote this in seconds.

2
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.832
Do you know what it does?

3
00:00:04.983 --> 00:00:06.113
Meet Unvibe.

4
00:00:06.308 --> 00:00:07.268
Select code.

5
00:00:07.308 --> 00:00:10.478
Press Control+U on Mac,
or Ctrl+Alt+U on Windows.

6
00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.460
Explain code beside your editor.

7
00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:15.920
New through Advanced are free.

8
00:00:16.147 --> 00:00:17.277
Expert is Pro.

9
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.470
See what breaks without it.

10
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.370
Ask about this exact query.

11
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.630
Get a follow-up answer.

12
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.470
Test me quizzes you on that exact code.

13
00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:36.997
Wrong answers are saved to revisit.

14
00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:41.917
A React hook, explained.

15
00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.037
Understand the cleanup phase.

16
00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:48.377
Review changes in four scopes.

17
00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:53.577
See which files matter first.

18
00:00:53.915 --> 00:00:56.245
The brief is free, built from local git.

19
00:00:56.978 --> 00:00:59.648
The AI explanation of a change is on Pro.

20
00:01:01.254 --> 00:01:03.204
Every lesson is saved to your Library.

21
00:01:04.854 --> 00:01:06.604
Reopen the code and explanation.

22
00:01:08.379 --> 00:01:10.533
A review quiz brings back what you missed.

23
00:01:12.055 --> 00:01:14.205
Reads the file's history on your computer.

24
00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:17.280
Explains why the line is there.

25
00:01:18.843 --> 00:01:19.923
Same panel on Windows.

26
00:01:19.963 --> 00:01:22.153
Ctrl+Alt+U.

27
00:01:23.722 --> 00:01:25.112
Only what you ask about.

28
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:28.350
Keys and tokens are filtered
on your computer first.

29
00:01:28.642 --> 00:01:30.452
Your repo is never uploaded.

30
00:01:32.124 --> 00:01:33.584
Try it in your browser first.

31
00:01:33.624 --> 00:01:34.624
No install.

32
00:01:35.647 --> 00:01:38.673
Know what it does, why it works,
and what breaks without it.

33
00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:40.975
Free for Mac and Windows.

34
00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.050
unvibe.site.

35
00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:45.440
Control+U on Mac, Ctrl+Alt+U on Windows.
